1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,860
Can your existing vehicle get to 100 million?

2
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:03,700
Yes.

3
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:06,700
Will it probably take 15 years?

4
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:07,860
Yes.

5
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:09,420
Are you okay with that?

6
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:10,400
That feels long.

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:14,380
I think in my brain, I'm doing other things in 10 years.

8
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:16,660
You might not see yourself in 10 years doing it

9
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:18,820
because you think about this times 10.

10
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:22,820
If in 10 years you were doing 40 million a year,

11
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:24,300
your life's different.

12
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:26,260
Your life at the pinnacle of success

13
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:28,140
in every business is the same.

14
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:31,320
Whether you sell widgets, back massages, or motorcycles,

15
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:32,160
it's gonna be the same thing.

16
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:33,940
Everyone feels like their business is really unique,

17
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:35,600
but the higher up you go, it's the same shit.

18
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,240
Maybe the biggest gift that I can give you

19
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:40,480
is that there is nothing on the other side of this rainbow.

